File Index

/express-service.ts
Purpose: Provides a standardized Express.js service configuration with security defaults and environment-based setup.

/index.ts
Purpose: This file re-exports all services to simplify imports throughout the application.

/logger-service.ts
Purpose: Provides structured logging with file rotation, JSON formatting, and SOH detection for server applications.

/mud-client-service.ts
Purpose: Manages MUD client connections and sessions with unique identifiers.

/telnet-client-service.ts
Purpose: Provides telnet client functionality with GMCP support and rate-limited message sending.
